ws you to buy new vehicles, tools, weapons and many other items of equipment to successfully fulfil your duties as a park ranger. It is therefore important to keep a constant eye on your park's rating and your finances.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622690/extras/e9bbcf7a435c77d57f7ada469dbd6b20.poster.avif?t=1771508089\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622690/extras/e9bbcf7a435c77d57f7ada469dbd6b20.webm?t=1771508089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622690/extras/e9bbcf7a435c77d57f7ada469dbd6b20.mp4?t=1771508089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of nine vehicles are available to help you overcome the upcoming challenges in the large game world. These include cars, boats and even a helicopter so that you are flexible on the road, on water, in the air and can get to the various mission locations quickly.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large game world with different biomes and cities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgradeable and expandable ranger camps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, repair and maintain the park </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic day and night cycle </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 different vehicles  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of animals </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 50 varied missions  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross-Platform Multiplayer </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied equipment  </p></li></ul>","developers":["Polygon Art"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622690/header.jpg?t=1771508089","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2024 AEROSOFT. All rights reserved. All trademarks and brand names are trademarks or registered trademarks of the respective owners. Copyrights are serious stuff. If you find any pirated copies of this software please notify us. We will make sure reports of copyrights violation are rewarded.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAerosoft GmbH<br />\r\nLindberghring 12<br />\r\nD-33142 B\u00fcren, Germany","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2622690/80341965/e40bde93b390095eb6ad9eda127b824d831ab2ef/1769756805/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771506664","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2622690/80341965/e40bde93b390095eb6ad9eda127b824d831ab2ef/1769756805/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771506664","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2622690/80341965/e40bde93b390095eb6ad9eda127b824d831ab2ef/1769756805/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771506664","id":257275857,"name":"Park Ranger | Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257275857/99ea08fa7f30b110fb8be966728a1b5f9ec3cf88/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1771506664"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2622690/742610/078a9829f70b392f97d3e244d7e086f884626b95/1750937183/dash_av1.mpd?t=1724162679","dash_h264":"https://video.aka